Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.39,0:00:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh! Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.45,0:00:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.69,0:01:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you're sitting down, Serenity,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.89,0:01:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,because your big brother\Nhad some pretty big news.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.33,0:01:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You made it to the Battle City Finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.05,0:01:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, how'd you guess, sis?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.57,0:01:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Tristan tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.89,0:01:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you're a great duelist, and I\Nknew all along you'd be a finalist.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.85,0:01:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.51,0:01:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.67,0:01:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't have done it\Nwithout your support.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.45,0:01:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,If it weren't for you and\Nmy buddies cheering me on,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.61,0:01:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no way I would have\Nwon these six locator cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.59,0:01:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wish you could have seen\Nold Joey in action, Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.43,0:01:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, guess what?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.81,0:01:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, what, sis?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.01,0:01:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I still can.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.65,0:01:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not too late, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.81,0:01:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the bandages?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.45,0:01:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought your eyes were still healing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.17,0:01:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, the doctor said I could\Ntake the bandages off tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.55,0:01:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That means I can get my wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.45,0:01:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The next sight I see will be my big\Nbro dueling in the Battle City Finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.37,0:01:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.57,0:01:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,So it sounds like you can come home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.15,0:01:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll send someone over to\Npick you up right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.77,0:01:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta prep for the finals, and\Nthere's no way you're traveling alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.05,0:02:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.23,0:02:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.71,0:02:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.71,0:02:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, easy with the technology, you spaz.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.87,0:02:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but Serenity takes\Nher bandages off tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.75,0:02:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's so awesome, Joey. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.93,0:02:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And she's coming to the finals with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.37,0:02:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What wonderful news.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.21,0:02:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I just need someone to go pick her up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.09,0:02:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone I can really depend on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.41,0:02:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But where am I going to find\Nsomeone on such short notice?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.95,0:02:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go and get her, you dimwit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.33,0:02:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You, no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.41,0:02:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, she'll be\Nin safe hands with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.15,0:02:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, come back. Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.63,0:02:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, Tristan is like family.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.43,0:02:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Kind of like that annoying\Ncousin who's always bugging you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.73,0:02:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.21,0:02:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Bakura, and he's hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.85,0:02:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakura!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.76,0:02:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.67,0:02:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I just found him lying on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.79,0:02:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't look so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.41,0:03:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I tried to take care of his injuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.97,0:03:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.01,0:03:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,He hasn't said a word since I found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.11,0:03:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We're buddies, but who do you\Nthink could have done this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.05,0:03:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.69,0:03:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakura! What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.65,0:03:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It happened so quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.27,0:03:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.11,0:03:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm lucky I found you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.03,0:03:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He needs to go to a hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.47,0:03:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.38,0:03:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.29,0:03:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like Bakura's the lucky one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.05,0:03:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take him to see a doctor right
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.51,0:03:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.42,0:03:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, give me a hand.\NCan do. There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.31,0:03:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.65,0:03:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll call if there's some news.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.15,0:03:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.06,0:03:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Best of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.97,0:03:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,See you later, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.89,0:03:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Moto.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.80,0:03:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Get that up, Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.71,0:03:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My friends are in a great\Ndeal of danger, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.27,0:03:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you've led me to the right place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.19,0:03:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.10,0:03:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friends are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.01,0:03:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.93,0:03:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you be certain? Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.67,0:03:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,KaibaCorp's satellite\Ntracking system traced Joey
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.27,0:03:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Wheeler's dual disk to\Nthese exact coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.11,0:03:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's foolproof.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.83,0:03:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Why Yugi cares about that\Nthird-rate duelist is beyond me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.57,0:04:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon he'll have bigger problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.25,0:04:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.25,0:04:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, fella.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.69,0:04:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What he means to say is we\Nhaven't introduced ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.63,0:04:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Namu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.54,0:04:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.05,0:04:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The name's Joey. I'm Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.71,0:04:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for all your help. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.27,0:04:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I just did what anyone would have done.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.75,0:04:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a duel disc on your arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.17,0:04:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but I'm afraid I'm\Nnot much of a duelist.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.01,0:04:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not challenging me\Nto a duel, are you, Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.01,0:04:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have to duel, because I\Nalready qualified for the finals, Namu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.57,0:04:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.15,0:04:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.61,0:04:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you could give me some tips one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.75,0:04:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll see if I can fit you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.87,0:04:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, I feel as though I've met you before.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.27,0:04:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.89,0:04:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Smell you later, Namu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.39,0:04:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice meeting you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.73,0:04:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like a nice enough guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.25,0:04:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.49,0:04:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Those fools have no idea who I really am\Nor the danger that's in store for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.15,0:05:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, my rare hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.11,0:05:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything is going according to plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.45,0:05:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So obey my orders and\Ndon't fail me this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.55,0:05:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You must bring me the two remaining\NEgyptian god cards and the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.77,0:05:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Millennium Puzzle and make sure that\Nlittle Yugi stays out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.87,0:05:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Permanently.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.91,0:05:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,In order for me to obtain the\Nultimate power of the Pharaoh,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.73,0:05:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,everything must occur\Nexactly as I planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.37,0:05:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,How shall we proceed, Master Maric?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.51,0:05:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Your task is to win me the two remaining\NEgyptian god cards. Yes, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.69,0:05:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Obtaining Obelisk the Tormentor\Nfrom Kaiba will be simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.29,0:05:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And winning Slifer the Sky Dragon from\NYugi will be equally as effortless.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.69,0:05:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We will not fail you, Master Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.17,0:05:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate the power of\Nthese Egyptian god cards, you fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.43,0:05:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Defeating them will be difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.09,0:05:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I've devised an alternate\Nplan to ensure that I get what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.95,0:05:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,While you keep Kaiba and\Nlittle Yugi occupied,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.35,0:06:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll turn my attention to\Nthose they care most about.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.61,0:06:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,With their friends and\Nloved ones in danger,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.19,0:06:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be sure to get exactly what I want,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.05,0:06:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,and soon I'll be the most\Npowerful being in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.65,0:06:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.67,0:06:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey! Taya! What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.85,0:06:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't mean to be an inconvenience,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.81,0:06:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,but can you give me a few\Ndueling tips right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.49,0:06:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, I can hit you with a few pointers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.13,0:06:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, I'd like to win at\Nleast one duel in Battle City.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.95,0:06:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You've come to the right place, Namu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.87,0:06:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I got so many dueling secrets,\Nit'll make your head spin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.97,0:06:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey! Taya!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.49,0:06:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,They're not here. Kaiba was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.89,0:06:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Just stick with me, Namu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.65,0:06:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be a dueling expert in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.69,0:06:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.60,0:06:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, look behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.47,0:06:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this! You got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.35,0:06:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Piece of cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.35,0:06:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go of her, you creep!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.33,0:06:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, what do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.99,0:06:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You're real tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.37,0:06:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you pick on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.81,0:06:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, behind you! You fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.31,0:07:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right? Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.99,0:07:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been better.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.05,0:07:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Expecting someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.31,0:07:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.77,0:07:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off of my stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.49,0:07:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard her. Lay off! Hello,\NTaya. Are you there? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.41,0:07:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yogi, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.59,0:07:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya, where are you? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.79,0:07:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna pay for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.43,0:07:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like your friend won't\Nfind you now. Are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.43,0:07:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya! Taya!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.23,0:07:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.11,0:07:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it appears that I've hit upon\Nyour sensitive spot, haven't I now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.93,0:07:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I will use your friends to get\Nwhat I want from you, namely your puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.83,0:07:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And the Egyptian God card\Nthat you won. Besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.59,0:07:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm always looking for new\Nservants to do my bidding,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.97,0:07:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,and your friends will make\Nthe perfect mine slaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.63,0:07:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.83,0:07:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew this was going to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.95,0:07:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick found my friends before I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.17,0:07:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But where did he take them?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.57,0:08:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.37,0:08:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems we're too late, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.81,0:08:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The rare hunters have\Nalready gotten to my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.57,0:08:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yugi, relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.05,0:08:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's obvious they're really after\Nyou and your Egyptian god card.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.01,0:08:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Not your pathetic friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.81,0:08:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,They're of no use to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.19,0:08:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, my satellite\Nwill track them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.65,0:08:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Wheeler's dual disk sends\Nout a constant signal,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.23,0:08:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,so finding your friends\Nwill be a simple task.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.87,0:08:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, you're going\Nto duel against me, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.17,0:08:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And your Egyptian God card will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.83,0:08:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,So get ready to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.43,0:08:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, you and I will duel soon enough,\Nbut not until my friends are safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.83,0:08:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.95,0:08:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, come in!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.09,0:08:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, Mokuba?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.29,0:08:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.41,0:08:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey Wheeler's duel disk isn't transmitting\Na signal to the satellite system.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.45,0:08:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I think something's blocking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.17,0:08:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go back to headquarters\Nand make sure the team
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.63,0:08:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,starts working on the\Ntracking problem right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.25,0:09:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.33,0:09:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.24,0:09:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll find those guys, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.59,0:09:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.57,0:09:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,When you do, let me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.99,0:09:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,There's been a minor setback.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.21,0:09:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Either my satellite system has a glitch,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.69,0:09:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,or these rare hunters are\Nsmarter than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.61,0:09:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,There he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.35,0:09:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.11,0:09:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.29,0:09:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the rush?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.91,0:09:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You're ours now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.21,0:09:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.73,0:09:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You're one of those rare\Nhunters, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.21,0:09:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I am, and today you're my prey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.95,0:09:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear it's your last\Nday with us, Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.53,0:09:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The doctor said you can take\Nyour bandages off tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.85,0:09:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.51,0:09:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I already know the first\Nthing I'm gonna see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.21,0:09:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah? And what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.07,0:09:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, my brother Doolin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.19,0:09:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,He just told me he made it\Nto the Battle City Finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.35,0:10:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.55,0:10:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Your brother must really\Nmean a lot to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.07,0:10:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,He's lucky to have a sister like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.07,0:10:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'm the lucky one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.85,0:10:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got the best brother in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.45,0:10:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,There they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.69,0:10:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and it's time to lure them\Nto the chosen dueling location.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.59,0:10:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.61,0:10:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Rare Hunter, what have\Nyou done with my friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.81,0:10:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That's for us to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.45,0:10:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And Seto Kaiba, look who\Nelse is coming with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.15,0:10:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Let him go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.27,0:10:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Big brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.18,0:10:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me, Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.55,0:10:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me, please! Mokuba!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.87,0:10:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, get me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.97,0:11:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Please help me, Seto! Mokuba!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.27,0:11:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Rare hunters, let my brother go now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.81,0:11:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,He's fine for now, but his\Nfuture's up in the air!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.43,0:11:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me, Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.67,0:11:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll pay for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.95,0:11:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,If you so much as touch one\Nhair on my brother's head,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.49,0:11:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise I'll hunt you all\Ndown and crush every one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.81,0:11:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,of you with the weight of\Nthe entire Kaiba Corporation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.61,0:11:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Your empty Cards will get you nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.77,0:11:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But there is one way to\Nsave your brother. Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.85,0:11:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet us at the top of\Nthat building, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.03,0:11:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That is, if you ever expect\Nto see your brother again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.21,0:11:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The choice is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.33,0:11:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.27,0:11:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And Kaiba's not the only one\Nwhose presence is required.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.61,0:11:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,If you expect to be reunited with your\Nfriends, you'll join us as well, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.79,0:11:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.85,0:12:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm warning you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.99,0:12:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave them alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.89,0:12:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll see you both shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.57,0:12:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, gentlemen, meet us on the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.25,0:12:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like we have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.05,0:12:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.03,0:12:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Our enemies are one and the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.33,0:12:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But make no mistake,\NI'm in this for Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.99,0:12:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,When it comes to rescuing your\Nfriends, you're on your own now, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.31,0:12:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.97,0:12:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I see you two decided to show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.55,0:12:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,A very wise choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.93,0:12:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, now tell us, what\Nis the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.71,0:12:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We've kept up our end of the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.97,0:12:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,so why don't you honor yours\Nand release the prisoners?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.11,0:12:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid it isn't that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.37,0:12:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You two will have to duel us first.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.19,0:12:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If you win, you'll see\Nyour loved ones again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.77,0:13:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Before the fun begins, allow\Nus to introduce ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.83,0:13:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Loomis.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.93,0:13:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Umbra.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.83,0:13:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You defeated us once before, but I assure\Nyou, you won't be so lucky in this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.69,0:13:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And if we do win, you'll\Nrelease our friends and family?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.55,0:13:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps, but there's no way you'll win.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.57,0:13:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let me explain the\Nrules of this match.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.37,0:13:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It will be a double\Nduel, us against you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.93,0:13:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Each duelist will receive\N4,000 life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.97,0:13:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You must defeat both of the other\Nteam's duelists in order to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.61,0:13:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And as for the losers, they'll\Npay a very hefty price.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.21,0:13:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,A trip to the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.59,0:13:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be delivered to the Dark\NWorld in the most ingenious of ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.83,0:13:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Notice where you're standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.47,0:13:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,On a thin surface above a 50-story light
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.03,0:13:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,shaft that runs all the\Nway to the ground floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.61,0:13:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you fall, you'll\Nnever reach the bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.95,0:13:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That's because the very surface on which\Nwe stand is a divider between our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.67,0:14:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,and the dreaded Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.93,0:14:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Each duelist's life\Npoints will be displayed
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.85,0:14:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,in the magic shadow box\Non the floor beside you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.65,0:14:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,When your life points reach zero,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.79,0:14:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,the surface below you will be destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.69,0:14:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,opening up a vortex that leads\Ndirectly to the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.77,0:14:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And according to Battle City rules,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.79,0:14:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,your rules, when we win we take\Nyour Egyptian god cards. Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.93,0:14:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I've left you speechless.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.09,0:14:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just waiting for you to finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.15,0:14:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I have your guarantee\Nthat my brother's all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.89,0:14:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but I wouldn't count\Non seeing him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.13,0:14:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you're in the Shadow\NRealm, there are no visitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.23,0:14:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks as if you've just made your\Nsecond mistake today, Rare Hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.81,0:14:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The first was kidnapping my brother,\Nand the second was challenging me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.33,0:14:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see about that, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.43,0:15:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And I will rescue my\Nfriends. Very touching, but
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.65,0:15:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We duel for our master\NMaric, and losing is not an
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.91,0:15:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,option our decks were\Nspecially assembled to take
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.89,0:15:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,down your egyptian god\Ncards and that's just what
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.65,0:15:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll do and once we\Ndeliver them to master maric
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.85,0:15:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,he'll possess all three\Negyptian god cards in
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.89,0:15:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,the meantime you'll be\Nspending all of eternity
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.31,0:15:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,in the shadow realm so if\Nyou're ready let's duel
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.27,0:15:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready to duel?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.31,0:15:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust you know the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.91,0:15:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, this duel is two against two.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.95,0:15:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Each player takes a separate turn,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.01,0:15:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,but players on the same team must work\Ntogether to defeat the opposing team.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.55,0:15:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.99,0:15:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well, Rare Hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.55,0:15:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll place two cards face\Ndown and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.71,0:15:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Make your move if you dare.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.91,0:15:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll only bring you closer\Nto the Shadow Realm. Roll!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.29,0:16:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll summon Beta, the Magnet\NWarrior, in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.27,0:16:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,My monster will protect my life points\Nfrom your attacks, rare hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.31,0:16:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can attack until each\Nduelist has drawn at least once.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.03,0:16:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hopefully by then, I can\Npick up on their strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.37,0:16:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Observe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.49,0:16:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Shining Abyss in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.89,0:16:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's time to show\Nyou how we duel together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.27,0:16:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,A team strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.83,0:16:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.17,0:16:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate Mask of Brutality.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.65,0:16:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Loomis.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.03,0:16:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mask will be a\Nperfect fit for my monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.91,0:16:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only that, Oprah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.67,0:16:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,but it will boost your monster's\Nattack power by a thousand points.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.27,0:16:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.18,0:16:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,These rare hunters already have a monster\Non the field with 2,600 attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.27,0:16:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.21,0:16:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,and it will stay that way as\Nlong as we each give up 1,000
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.37,0:17:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,life points for every turn we\Nplan to use Mask of Brutality.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.71,0:17:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But now we won't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.81,0:17:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Observe, as I activate a\Nmagic card called Masked Doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.11,0:17:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,My Masked Doll will absorb any and all\Nnegative effects caused by my magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.79,0:17:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice work.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.87,0:17:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Now our life points will remain\Nuntouched by our mask of brutality.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.81,0:17:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You fools are no match for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.81,0:17:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.63,0:17:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And our tag team strategy\Nwill destroy you. I doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.47,0:17:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We can play off the\Nstrengths of each other's
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.45,0:17:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,cards and work as a\Nteam as well as you can,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.97,0:17:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,rare hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.29,0:17:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.65,0:17:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Teamwork is for boy scouts\Nin nursery schools, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.03,0:17:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.94,0:17:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get one thing straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.87,0:17:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I can win this duel and save\Nmy brother without your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.95,0:17:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the world's greatest duelist,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.71,0:17:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,and when I win the Battle City\NTournament, I'll prove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.73,0:17:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.03,0:18:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll place two cards face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.99,0:18:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.19,0:18:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll summon Force Raider, the Man Beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.19,0:18:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And I place my monster in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.55,0:18:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.69,0:18:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,His monster's weaker than theirs!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.29,0:18:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And if we don't have a team\Nstrategy, we'll never win!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.35,0:18:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.29,0:18:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got an extremely\Npowerful monster ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.45,0:18:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Next turn, I'll sacrifice my Virus Raider\Nand summon it to the field. Teamwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.95,0:18:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we've each taken one turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.95,0:18:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's time to see whose\Nstrategy is superior.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.03,0:18:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you'll find the\Nanswer to that is obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.63,0:18:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.89,0:18:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Due to our team's strategy, we have\Nthe most powerful monster on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.99,0:18:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Might I remind you our decks\Nwere specifically created
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.99,0:18:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,to work together to defeat\Nyour Egyptian god cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.37,0:18:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel has just begun, Rare Hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.01,0:18:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.27,0:18:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The safety of my friends depends on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.29,0:19:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But unless Kaiba agrees to work\Ntogether as a team, we're doomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.23,0:19:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,If he keeps up this selfish attitude,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.87,0:19:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll lose this duel and be\Ntransported to the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.91,0:19:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And Merrick will have all\Nthree Egyptian god cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.85,0:19:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, who knows what will happen to\Nthe gang under Merrick's control?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.43,0:19:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to defeat these rare hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.87,0:19:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,the fate of my friends, and\Nthe world depends on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.97,0:19:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the only one who's competing
